{"v":4,"desc":"Caladrius Blaze是在MOSS社開發的縱向卷軸射擊遊戲。Caladrius Blaze裡包括Caladrius和Caladrius AC的所有要素。何況不止這些，遊戲還提供新的階段、新的故事、新的頭目以及安田典生設計的新的角色。\n\n主要遊戲特徴\n- 總共15名以上有個性的角色創造的多種故事模式\n- 8種含有不同能力的機器和主人公。\n- 提供角色服裝破壞引發性感場景的‘羞恥破壞’系統\n- 可以戰略性升級武器的‘元素射擊’系統\n- 新手也容易上手的‘教學模式’和‘同步模式’","publisher":"H2 INTERACTIVE","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["射擊"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["英文","韓文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 2.9GB / Switch 2.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/34673eca368a80e10bab5701aec9147df683ebeb0326dfa68258713cfd8d4f69.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/29c0a44ff63cc18bee4fec510d2ed140b365609128a93f27f6cec277f5785690.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ee7fd45b48eed98bfbf96e16ca5b6d27eb2a94def8d61e2dab65a1d2b2123185.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/90c4043a80c9b01f443f367862e01e3e1ac78b8f10041d6c3c34124341597eec.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26d6fb71441bbdf447bb8952db84b3192999e4ac2496293a9d7f5d3613d99bb2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/35de27855c92fc907e3167c3c194655225677bd7484360110d4422a545d3e98e.jpg"],"titleId":"01004fd00d66a000","dlc":[]}